{"4429720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deductopia", "steam_appid": 4429720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you think you're a detective? Try your skills in the world of Deductopia! Twelve zany and creative chapters take you through chaos in the classroom, mix-ups at the train station, confusion at the skate park, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the scenes, find clues, and sort out people, pets, and belongings in a cozy, low-stakes setting.<br><br>Fans of Duck Detective, Little Problems, and The Case of the Worst Day Ever will enjoy this new deduction game for all ages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique scenes, each featuring a fill-in-the-blanks deduction puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace: Scenes can be completed in any order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn artwork inspired by The Magic School Bus, Where's Waldo, and Highlights Magazine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original sountrack by Starling Tan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For adults and children of all ages</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you think you're a detective? Try your skills in the world of Deductopia! Twelve zany and creative chapters take you through chaos in the classroom, mix-ups at the train station, confusion at the skate park, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the scenes, find clues, and sort out people, pets, and belongings in a cozy, low-stakes setting.<br><br>Fans of Duck Detective, Little Problems, and The Case of the Worst Day Ever will enjoy this new deduction game for all ages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique 